1. 参考已有代码风格: MaterialLibrariesPO.java, MaterialLibrariesDao.java, MaterialLibrariesMapper.java
2. AbstractDao基类提供了 throwServiceException(Logger logger, String opName) 和 getMapper(Class<T> type) 方法
3. DBConstant中定义了 DB_NAME = "datasmartcubedb"
