AbstractDao基类：
```java
package com.huawei.ncedatacubeplus.datasmartcubeservice.simplifieddao.dao;

import com.huawei.wax.db.DBContext;
import com.huawei.wax.utils.bean.ContextUtil;
import com.huawei.wax.utils.exception.ServiceException;
import lombok.Getter;
import lombok.Setter;
import org.slf4j.Logger;

@Getter
@Setter
public class AbstractDao {
    protected void throwServiceException(Logger logger, String opName) throws ServiceException {
        logger.error("Operation name: {}, Error code: {}, related service: {}",
            opName, "Operate DB Failed", "DataSmartCubeService");
        throw new ServiceException(String.format(
            "操作失败: %s, 错误代码: %s, 相关服务: %s",
            opName, "Operate DB Failed", "DataSmartCubeService"));
    }

    public <T> T getMapper(Class<T> type) {
        DBContext.setActiveDb(DBConstant.DB_NAME);
        return ContextUtil.getBean(type);
    }
}
```

MaterialLibrariesDao参考（注意insert方法的try-catch和异常处理模式）：
```java
@Component
public class MaterialLibrariesDao extends AbstractDao {
    private static final Logger LOGGER = LoggerFactory.getLogger(MaterialLibrariesDao.class);

    public void insert(List<MaterialLibrariesPO> materialLibrariesPOList) throws ServiceException {
        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(materialLibrariesPOList)) {
            return;
        }
        try {
            MaterialLibrariesMapper mapper = getMapper(MaterialLibrariesMapper.class);
            mapper.insert(materialLibrariesPOList);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            LOGGER.error("insert failed. {}", e.getMessage());
            throwServiceException(LOGGER, "insert material");
        }
    }
}
```

MaterialLibrariesPO参考：
```java
